# NanGate45 mapping — MANUAL TEMPLATE only.
#
# Yosys `.ys` front-end does NOT Tcl-expand `$::env(...)`.
# Automation writes `build/yosys_map_nangate_run.ys` with an embedded absolute path.
# Run:
#   python scripts/run_all_experiments.py
#
# To run by hand: copy the four lines below into a new `.ys`, replace LIB twice,
# then from project root: yosys -s your_script.ys
#
# read_liberty -ignore_miss_func LIB
# read_verilog -sv rtl/sb_lut_baseline.v
# hierarchy -check -top SB
# synth -top SB -flatten
# opt
# dfflibmap -liberty LIB
# abc -liberty LIB
# opt_clean
# stat -liberty LIB
# write_verilog -noattr -noparallelcase build/sb_mapped_nangate.v
